From: A23 bring-up <a23@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] CTS: use the selected stock-vendor policy inputs

The A23 stock vendor has no separate ODM CIL. Keep CTS enabled and use the
same complete input set as precompiled_sepolicy, including API 30 mappings.
Concatenate the CIL inputs so host data does not flatten identically named
mapping outputs from different partitions. Both seamendc comparisons compile
the same policy; products without the A23 selector retain their original inputs.

Target: platform/cts refs/tags/android-17.0.0_r1.

diff --git a/tools/selinux/Android.bp b/tools/selinux/Android.bp
--- a/tools/selinux/Android.bp
+++ b/tools/selinux/Android.bp
@@ -1,44 +1,60 @@
 // Copyright (C) 2021 The Android Open Source Project
